# Blue Ward's protection from blue removes other blue Auras from the creature (CR 702.16c, 704.5m) but not Blue Ward
# itself (CR 702.16n: "This effect doesn't remove this Aura"). Bot1's Devoted Hero wears Curious Obsession (blue)
# first; when Blue Ward resolves on it, state-based actions put Curious Obsession into the graveyard and Ward stays.
# Painter's Servant then names blue, so Blue Ward is itself blue (CR 105.3) and still protects from blue: it stays.

